  "content": "<p>我看到原始模組的玩家們需要這個模組，所以我製作了一個<em><strong>非官方</strong></em>的1.16版本</p><p>[<strong>如有任何問題，請回報</strong>]</p><p>&nbsp;請確保您已安裝Forge：</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oeSBh9T.png\" width=\"192\" height=\"112\"></a></p><p>造訪原始模組<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-elytra\" rel=\"nofollow\">請點此</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>合成配方保持不變</p><p>此外，還新增了使用幻翼薄膜的第二種合成方式</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>希望大家都喜歡這個模組</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kkcFcix.png\"></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/6IbLyTyFuW6OMQL2pa8WL4yjDqOuTMHRWGm8-H_l3-g/https/i.imgur.com/SYB1SLX.png?format=webp&amp;quality=lossless\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"698\" height=\"245\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>模組特色：</p><ul>\n<li>右側鞘翅</li>\n<li>鞘翅合成</li>\n<li>進度【<strong>讓我們...翱翔？</strong>】</li>\n<li>僅包含右側鞘翅的創造模式物品欄<strong>._.</strong></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>原始模組創作者授權[<span style=\"color:#f00\">已獲得同意</span>]</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tLRk7PE.png\" width=\"898\" height=\"387\"></p><p>其他<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hir0shiyt/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的</a>&nbsp;專案：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><strong>骷髏頭礦石</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-skull-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-skull-ore</a></li>\n<li><strong>三叉戟合成與結構 -</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftable-elytra-reworked/settings/Trident Crafting &amp; Structures - curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trident-crafting-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"> curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trident-crafting-structures</a></li>\n<li><strong>不死圖騰礦石模組</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/totem-ore-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/totem-ore-mod</a></li>\n<li><strong>凋零骷髏礦石</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wither-skeleton-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wither-skeleton-ore</a></li>\n<li><strong>三叉戟合成[Fabric] -&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trident-crafting-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trident-crafting-fabric</a></li>\n<li><strong>終界加強版[FORGE] -&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-plus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-plus-forge</a></li>\n<li><strong>主世界礦模組</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overworldium\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overworldium</a></li>\n</ul>",
